From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: owner <owner@localhost>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 23:52:06 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 07/11] Taviri: read taviri:recipe as well as grokbot:recipe
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Saved entry steps are read from a custom field named `taviri:recipe`
(the Taviri connector's name) or the older `grokbot:recipe`; with both,
`taviri:recipe` wins, and names ignore case and accents, as in the
connector. The notice for a broken recipe names the field it read.
Taviri's own settings (`taviri:icon`…) are also kept out of Bitwarden's
custom-field fill.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
